  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>Watchdog Manager (WdgM)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Performs alive supervision, deadline supervision, and logical program flow monitoring.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Funktionen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00151\">WdgM_Init</a> (const WdgM_ConfigType* ConfigPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initializes the Watchdog Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00261\">WdgM_DeInit</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">De - initializes the Watchdog Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00153\">WdgM_GetVersionInfo</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* VersionInfo);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the version information of this module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00154\">WdgM_SetMode</a> ();</code> <span class=\"dim\">Sets the current mode of Watchdog Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00168\">WdgM_GetMode</a> (WdgM_ModeType* Mode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the current mode of the Watchdog Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00263\">WdgM_CheckpointReached</a> (WdgM_SupervisedEntityIdType SEID, WdgM_CheckpointIdType Checkpoint ID);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Indicates to the Watchdog Manager that a Checkpoint within a Supervised Entity has been reached.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00169\">WdgM_GetLocalStatus</a> (WdgM_SupervisedEntityIdType SEID, Wdg M_Local <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"os.html#SWS_Os_00002\">StatusType</a>* Status);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the supervision status of an individual Supervised Entity.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00175\">WdgM_GetGlobalStatus</a> (Wdg M_Global <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"os.html#SWS_Os_00002\">StatusType</a>* Status);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the global supervision status of the Watchdog Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00264\">WdgM_PerformReset</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Instructs the Watchdog Manager to cause a watchdog reset.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00346\">WdgM_GetFirstExpiredSEID</a> (WdgM_SupervisedEntityIdType* SEID);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns SEID that first reached the stat e WDGM_ LOCAL_ STATUS_ EXPIRED.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00159\">WdgM_MainFunction</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Performs the processing of the cyclic Watchdog Manager jobs.</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Typen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00355\">WdgM_ConfigType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This structure contains all post - build configurable parameters of the Watchdog Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00356\">WdgM_SupervisedEntityIdType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type identifies an individual Supervised Entity for the Watchdog Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00357\">WdgM_CheckpointIdType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type identifies a Checkpoint in the context of a Supervised Entity for the Watchdog Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00334\">WdgM_Mode</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">The category of Mode Declaration Group Wdg M_ Mode is EXPLICIT_ ORDER, The attribute value for the Mode Declaration are set as...</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00359\">WdgM_LocalStatusType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type shall be used for variables that represent the current status of supervision for individual Supervised Entitie s.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00360\">WdgM_GlobalStatusType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type shall be used for variables that represent the global supervision status of the Watchdog Manager module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00358\">WdgM_ModeType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type distinguishes the different modes that were configured for the Watchdog Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_WdgM_00150\">globalmode</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">-</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
