   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_WdgM_00355\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> WdgM_ConfigType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_WdgM_00355\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_WdgM_00355]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_WatchdogManager.pdf#nameddest=SWS_WdgM_00355\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_WatchdogManager.pdf (Anker: #SWS_WdgM_00355, S. 76)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This structure contains all post - build configurable parameters of the Watchdog Manager. A pointer to this structure is passed to the Watchdog Manager initialization function for configuration. AUTOSAR CP R20 - of D ocument ID : AUTOSAR_SWS_WatchdogManager</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_WdgM_00356\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> WdgM_SupervisedEntityIdType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_WdgM_00356\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_WdgM_00356]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_WatchdogManager.pdf#nameddest=SWS_WdgM_00356\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_WatchdogManager.pdf (Anker: #SWS_WdgM_00356)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type identifies an individual Supervised Entity for the Watchdog Manager.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_WdgM_00357\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> WdgM_CheckpointIdType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_WdgM_00357\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_WdgM_00357]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_WatchdogManager.pdf#nameddest=SWS_WdgM_00357\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_WatchdogManager.pdf (Anker: #SWS_WdgM_00357)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type identifies a Checkpoint in the context of a Supervised Entity for the Watchdog Manager. Note that an individual Checkpoint can only be identified by the pair of Supervised Entity ID and Checkpoint ID.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_WdgM_00334\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> WdgM_Mode <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_WdgM_00334\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_WdgM_00334]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_WatchdogManager.pdf#nameddest=SWS_WdgM_00334\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_WatchdogManager.pdf (Anker: #SWS_WdgM_00334, S. 98)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>The category of Mode Declaration Group Wdg M_ Mode is EXPLICIT_ ORDER, The attribute value for the Mode Declaration are set as following: \"SUPERVISION_ OK\" = 0 \"SUPERVISION_ FAILED\" = 1 \"SUPERVISION_ EXPIRED\" = 2 \"SUPERVISION_ STOPPED\" = 3 \"SUP ERVISION_ DEACTIVATED\" = 4 The on Transition Value is defined as 255</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
